    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n759" root="اسف" body-key="A">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَسِفٌ</span></b>  (M, Mgh, Msb) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اسِفٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَسْفَانُ</span></b> 
and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَسِيفٌ</span></b>  (M, TA) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَسُوفٌ</span></b>  (M) <i>Angry:</i>
(Mgh, Msb, TA:) or <i>exceedingly angry.</i> (M.)
For an ex. of the first, see 1. See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَسِيفٌ</span>, in
two places.

